  "html": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Tortella humilis in Moss Flora of China @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=4\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-4.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Moss Flora of China home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='4' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\">Moss China V. 2 Page 225</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Moss China</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='volume_page.aspx?volume_id=4002&flora_id=4'  TARGET='_top' >Moss China V. 2</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=10727'  TARGET='_top' >Pottiaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=4&start_taxon_id=10727'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=4&taxon_id=133159'  TARGET='_top' >Tortella</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=4&start_taxon_id=133159'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n2. <b>Tortella humilis</b> (Hedw.) Jenn., A Manual of the Mosses of Western Pennsylvania.  96:13.  1913; Barbula humilis Hedw., Sp. Musc. Frond. 116, pl. 25, f. 1–4. 1801. \n<p>丛叶纽藓  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\nTrichostomum humile (Hedw.) Mach., Cat. Descr. Briol. Portug. 50. 1919.\nMollia caespitosa (Schwaegr.) Broth., Acta Soc. Sci. Fenn. 19(5): 14. 1891. Tortella caespitosa (Schwaegr.) Limpr., Laubm. Deutschl. 1: 600. 1888. Tortula caespitosa (Schwaegr.) Hook. & Grev. in Brewst., Edinburgh J. Sci. 1: 296. 1824. Barbula caespitosa Schwaegr., Sp. Musc. Frond., Suppl. 1, 1: 120, f. 31. 1811.<p>\r\n\r\nPlants small, ca. 1 cm high, yellowish green, in loose tufts. Stems erect, usually simple. Leaves strongly crisped when dry, erect-spreading or reflexed when moist, ligulate to narrowly oblong, often channeled above, narrowly acute or bluntly apiculate, somewhat sheathing at base; margins plane or somewhat undulate or narrowly incurved, entire to weakly crenulate with projecting papillae; costa percurrent or ending just below the apex; upper leaf cells quadrate to hexagonal, unistratose, pluripapillose; basal cells often sharply differentiated, rectangular, smooth, forming a V-shaped base. Autoicous. Sporophytes not seen.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nType. USA: Pennsylvania.  \n<p>\nChinese specimens examined: HUNAN: Sang-zhi Co., D.-K. Li 18297 (HKAS, SHM). SHANXI: Ning-wu Co., S.-L. Chang 86044 (HKAS). XIZANG: Ya-dong Co., M. Zang 487 (HKAS); Zhu-mu-long-ma-feng (Mt. Everest), X.-G. Wang 96 (PE). YUNNAN: Kun-ming City, Z.-M. Li s.n. (HYUB). <p>\r\nHabitat: on rocks or forest ground; Distribution: China, Japan, western Asia, Russia, Europe, throughout America, Africa, and Pacific islands. <p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\nIllustrations: Zander 1993 (Pl. 18, figs. 1–10).<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        </P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"></span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                